#11950
"A Ledge on a Cliff"
"This rocky outcrop in the side of the cliff provides a good place for rest
before completing the rest of the climb.  The ledge has a slight overhang,
over which a long drop can be seen.  Upward the path appears far easier, and
could be scaled with ease.  Small plants have managed somehow to find purchase
in thin crevices on the cliff face, and are the only visible form of life in
this small space.
"
""
