E
"stained glass window"
"These huge panes of stained glass are set high into the wall.  This large
example depicts what appears to be a saint, surrounded by a glowing aura, with
smiling people surrounding him.
"
E
"path smooth"
"Here the path is formed of huge paving slabs, untouched by season but worn by
the feet of many a pilgrim and worshiper.
"
E
"shrubs hill"
"Shrubs, overflowing from the hillside, have begun to make their mark upon the
surface of the paving slabs.  They creep across the path attempting to gain
purchase.
"
